      <Comment source="BioCyc">Random hydrolysis of 1,4- a-D-galactosiduronic linkages in pectate and other galacturonans. In fact, the reaction equation should be like: 1,4-&amp;alpha;-D-galacturonosyl&lt;sub&gt;(m+n)&lt;/sub&gt; = 1,4-&amp;alpha;-D-galacturonosyl&lt;sub&gt;(m)&lt;/sub&gt; + 1,4-&amp;alpha;-D-galacturonosyl&lt;sub&gt;(n)&lt;/sub&gt;. The current software is not yet able to support such an equation.</Comment>
